Environments Configuration
Environments Configuration / Introduction to Vite environment configuration
Overview of environment configuration for SPA/MPA, similar to Vite 5, and the use of the `environments` config option.

If the app is composed of several environments, then these environments can be configured explicitly with the `environments` config option.

```js
export default {
  build: {
    sourcemap: false,
  },
  optimizeDeps: {
    include: ['lib'],
  },
  environments: {
    server: {},
    edge: {
      resolve: {
        noExternal: true,
      },
    },
  },
}
```

