Conditional Application
Configuring conditional plugin application
In cases where a plugin needs to be conditionally applied only during serve or build, use the `apply` property to only invoke them during `'build'` or `'serve'`:

```js
function myPlugin() {
  return {
    name: 'build-only',
    apply: 'build', // or 'serve',
  }
}
```

