Conditional Application
Conditional Application / Precise control over plugin application using functions
Explains how to use a function for the apply property to implement complex logic, such as excluding SSR.

A function can also be used for more precise control:

```js
apply(config, { command }) {
  // apply only on build but not for SSR
  return command === 'build' && !config.build.ssr
}
```

